      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since the release of SDK3, SDK2 has been deprecated (for over a year now). I don't think it's a reasonable expectation for VRChat to maintain it.\nRecreating content in SDK3 isn't too difficult, depending on what your world contains. There's several example prefabs included with the SDK itself, there's lots of tutorials in the official docs & on YouTube. There's also an experimental SDK2 -> SDK3 converter by CyanLaser, though I haven't tried that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
