  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-06T14:19:13.520Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Not everything calls for an udon approach. Sometimes, sdk2 will do just fine. It would be nice if constraints were whitelisted. Rigidbody joints are garbage.",
